To prove part (b), compute  $\angle AIB = 90^\circ + \tfrac12\angle C = 105^\circ$ .  From  $(*)$ ,  $\angle AID = \angle BIE = 105^\circ$ , ergo
\[
\angle DIE = 360^\circ - 3\cdot 105^\circ = 45^\circ.
\]

